# The menus in a short landscape window (844 x 390): Help, Settings (the
# palette and left-handed controls), Profile (a guest name), Challenges, a
# Practice run on Stage 1 (Standard) with pause, undo, retry and leave, the
# resumable run on the title, then the Daily started and left.
# viewport 844x390@1
until 600 Trickstep Tower
frames 30
click =Help & Rules
until 300 Rule cards
frames 10
save tt-land-help
key Escape 1
until 300 ▶ Play
frames 10
click =Settings
until 300 Color-vision palette
frames 10
click =Left-handed touch controls
frames 10
save tt-land-settings
key Escape 1
until 300 ▶ Play
frames 10
click =Profile
until 300 Guest mode
frames 10
click Guest
type Ada
frames 5
click =Save name
until 300 ▶ Play
frames 10
click ▶ Play
until 300 Choose a Mode
frames 10
click =Challenge: Play
until 300 Few Careful Steps
frames 10
save tt-land-challenges
key Escape 1
until 300 Choose a Mode
frames 10
click =Practice: Play
until 300 Start Practice
frames 10
save tt-land-practice
click =Start Practice
until 400 GO
frames 30
hold ArrowRight
frames 80
release ArrowRight
key KeyU 1
frames 10
save tt-land-run
key Escape 1
until 300 Resume
frames 10
save tt-land-pause
click =Retry (R)
until 400 GO
frames 40
key Escape 1
until 300 Leave level
frames 10
click =Leave level
until 300 Resume paused run
frames 10
save tt-land-title
click Daily
until 400 GO
frames 30
key KeyP 1
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Leave level
until 300 ▶ Play
frames 10
